{"id":"vod_bf_16008","vodId":"16008","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"结城友奈是勇者第二季","name_cn":"结城友奈是勇者第二季","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/cf6e5528395aa7b945700702f8c462c7.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在神世纪300年，主要讲述结城友奈是初中2年级学生，她天天在学校里过着与很多朋友一同听课、进行社团活动、玩耍的平稳生活。不管怎么看这都是非常普通的女孩的生活日程，但是只有一点与其他孩子决定性不同的地方，那就是她所属的名为“勇者部”的社团活动。以部长犬吠埼风为中心的该社团的活动内容与被谜团包围的叫做Vertex的不可思议的存在有关系，本作正是以描写友奈等人的“勇者部”的活动为主。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:15:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhedierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiech